Z||000027||Galen||12-31-2001||10:06 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Formula88:<BR>Wow, he ventures off his porch to make a slam.  No, nevermind he's still safe at his computer.<P>Hmmm.  Japanese cars.  Outrageous graphics, body kits and wings.   Yeah.  Not about rice.  Definately not.[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I tell ya, I dislike ricers as much as the next guy. No doubting I have 'slammed' many in my time, I've even had a guy flame me in email about it one time(all of which I found rather amusing). since I dont wanna create a flame war between you and me, simply cuz I dont have the time to waste like you, I do have a life on my lil porch. I'll simply ask this question, whats wrong with imports? with "Outrageous graphics"? "Body Kits"? and "wings"? ... I hear ppl everyday say "I would love to have one of aus's stage 2 kits" .. is it rice? no. alot of forum members have "graphics" on their cars of a Pegasus.. dont fall down, its true. and wings? have you ever seen the size of a fiero wing? they are rather large and proven useless by more than one forum member.<P>I admit that supra in F&F needed to lose its wing, after that it'd be a beautiful car. and would hand almost any car on this forum its a$$ in a handbasket(with a little pink napkin). <P>Happy New Year Formula88, I hope you grow a brain next year  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">Ray</FONT></B> - The Donut Man!||||reg||1
